LightJev
Copyright 2026 RongxinAI contributors

An independent implementation inspired by the decision-model interface described
by TypeSafe AI and the open research direction explored by TianyuCodings/NanoJev.
LightJev is not affiliated with TypeSafe AI. No official Jev training recipe,
model weights, or calibration guarantees are claimed. Upstream model licenses
apply separately to any pretrained backbones selected by users.

Training-data attribution
The Qwen3-0.6B experiment uses C-Tianyu / TianyuCodings NanoJev-Data,
https://huggingface.co/datasets/C-Tianyu/NanoJev-Data, revision
87061eb91e8fc687e9b046454afdcc5551e3eff7. Every stage1 source record declares
CC0-1.0 in metadata; the upstream repository has no blanket license declaration.
The preparation script converts questions to LightJev records and retains only
programmatic deterministic or exact conditional-distribution targets. Teacher
outputs are excluded. These records are not relabeled as Apache-2.0 data.
See docs/data.md for hashes, exclusions, and attribution details.
